v><div class=\"space-y-1 mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted truncate\"><span class=\"text-ink-faint text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mr-1.5\">CPU</span>Ryzen 7 7800X3D</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted truncate\"><span class=\"text-ink-faint text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mr-1.5\">GPU</span>ASRock Taichi RX 7900 XTX</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide\">CB23</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">16,864</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide\">1080p</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">441 fps</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide\">CPU°</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">91°</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide\">GPU°</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">66°</span></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"bg-surface border-y border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/5 to-accent/10 border border-accent/20 p-10 md:flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><div class=\"mb-6 md:mb-0\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-3\">New</p><h2 class=\"mb-3\">Running local AI?</h2><p class=\"text-ink-muted max-w-lg\">Small form factor PCs are ideal for local LLM inference — whisper-quiet, always-on, and surprisingly capable. Browse builds optimized for Ollama, LM Studio, and Stable Diffusion filtered by VRAM and real-world inference benchmarks.</p></div><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/ai-builds\">Explore AI builds →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16\"><h2 class=\"text-center mb-12\">How ComponentWatch works</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-line mb-4\">01</p><h3 class=\"mb-2\">Real builds, real benchmarks</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Every build in the library has been physically assembled and tested. Benchmark scores come from actual hardware, not manufacturer specs.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-line mb-4\">02</p><h3 class=\"mb-2\">Live component prices</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Component prices update every 30 minutes from Newegg, Best Buy, eBay, and Amazon. Get alerted when a part in your watchlist drops.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-line mb-4\">03</p><h3 class=\"mb-2\">Submit your own build</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Built a compact PC? Share it with the community. Add your benchmarks and it becomes a permanent reference for future builders.</p></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold up